      "id": "sec-about",
      "type": "rf-offer-card",
      "label": "About",
      "blocks": [],
      "enabled": true,
      "config": {
        "props": {
          "columns": 1,
          "heading": "",
          "bulletGlyph": "✦",
          "padTop": 16,
          "padBottom": 12,
          "marginBottom": "6rem",
          "muted": "rgba(232, 229, 218, 0.65)",
          "items": [
            {
              "anchorId": "about",
              "title": "Background",
              "sub": "Practice, training, and orientation",
              "body": "I live in a small forest in Sweden, on a homestead we're slowly learning to run. Most things here have been figured out the hard way. Carrying water from a neighbour's well, making firewood, learning to grow food from scratch. It has been a good teacher in paying attention to what's actually there rather than what you expect to find.\n\nI've been drawn to what moves beneath the surface since I was a child. That curiosity became a practice, and the practice became this work. I hold certifications in mediumship, Usui Reiki Master/Teacher, and soul guide work, and I've spent years developing a way of reading energetic fields that is closer to structural mapping than interpretation.\n\nI receive through clairsentience and claircognizance. I feel what is happening in a field directly, in my own system, and translate that into something grounded and usable. I also work with light language, spoken and through movement, when a field needs direct intervention rather than reflection.",
